response:
 For nonnegative integers $n$, define $f(n)$ as the right hand side of the formula $a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n+mn.$ Then for nonnegative integers $m$ and $n$, it follows that
\begin{align*} f(m+1+n) &= f(m)+f(n)+m+(n+1)\\ &=f(m)+f(n)+m+n+1\\ &=a_m+a_n+a_{n+1}+mn+((n+1)+m)\\ &=a_m+a_{m+1}+a_n+((m+1)+n)\\ &=a_{m+1}+a_n+(m+1)n \end{align*}
so $a_{m+1+n}=a_{m+1}+a_n+(m+1)n.$ This is the same formula as $a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n+mn$ for nonnegative integers $m$ and $n$, so by induction $\{a_k\}$ is truly a sequence of integers. Now let $n=m$ in the formula $a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n+mn$ to see that $a_2=3.$ Now note that $a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n+mn=a_n+a_m+nm$ so $a_m+a_n=2(a_{m+n}-mn)$ for all positive integers $m$ and $n$ and also that $$a_m+a_n=2R_{m+n}$$ holds for all positive integers $m$ and $n$ where $$R_n=a_n+fn$$ for some function $f:\mathbb{Z}^+ \rightarrow \mathbb{Z}.$ It follows that $a_m+a_n=2(a_{m+n}-mn)$ holds for all positive integers $m$ and $n$ which implies that $a_{m+n}+2mn+a_m+a_n=2R_{m+n}+2fm+2fn=2R_{m+n}+2f_{m+n}=a_{m+n}+2R_{m+n}$ which implies that $fm+fn=f_{m+n}$ for all positive integers $m$ and $n$, which implies that $f$ is a linear function, say $f$ is equal to $ax+b$ for some integers $a$ and $b$. Now $$a_m+a_n=2(a_{m+n}-mn)\Rightarrow a_m+a_n=2R_{m+n}-2m(a_{1+n}-a_{1}n)=2R_{m+n}-2m(an+b-1-n)\Rightarrow 0=2a_{1}n-2an(a_{1}n+an+2b)+2a+2bn,$$ from which we see that $a \geq 0, 2b \leq 0,$ and $a_{1} \leq 2n$ which implies that $a_{1}=0$. Thus $b=0$ as well, so we find that $f$ is the zero function, so $a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n+mn=a_m+a_n+0\Rightarrow a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n.$ It follows that $\{a_k\}$ is a thin sequence satisfying $a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n$ for all positive integers $m$ and $n$. It follows by induction that the first five terms of $\{a_k\}$ are 1, 2, 2+1*1=3, 3+2*1=5, 5+3*1=8. Since $a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n$ holds for all positive integers $m$ and $n$ and $1+2+3+4+5+8=23$, it follows that the seventh term in the sequence must be 11. It follows by induction that the eighth term is 16, the ninth term is 22, the tenth term is 29, the eleventh term is 37, and the twelfth term is 47. Done.</answer>

